readme.text:
The plugin adds its own **Short tool-call IDs** tab to Settings, containing:

- a heading and a short explanation;
- a notice that it is an experimental workaround;
- every model provider, each with its own switch, which is **off by default**.

- the tab rendered;
- the switch saved, and on 0.2 persisted across a restart;
- the provider received 53-character IDs while the switch was on;
- the saved session kept the original IDs;
- switching off restored the original IDs on the next request (checked on 0.2).
